    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 6.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se þe ðeof wrecan wille ⁊ nanne mon ne gewundige, gesylle þam cyninge CXX scll' to wite for ðan æhlype.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he who seeks to avenge a thief, but does not wound anyone, shall pay a fine of 120 shillings to the king for [making such an] assault.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe ðeof wræcan wille ⁊ nænne man gewundige, gesylle ðam cyng CXX scill. for þon æhlype.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
